sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Producer Application
    participant O as Module Outbox
    participant D as Dispatcher
    participant T as Transport
    participant V as Inbound Adapter
    participant I as Consumer Inbox
    participant C as Consumer Application
    A->>O: freeze Event Envelope and payload in local transaction
    O->>D: immutable logical bytes plus delivery state
    D->>T: map frozen headers and payload
    T->>V: at-least-once delivery
    V->>V: validate type, version, IDs, producer, tenant
    alt permanent or security failure
        V-->>V: quarantine, audit, bounded alert
    else valid event
        V->>I: dedupe by consumer plus EventId
        I->>C: ExecutionContext with OperationId = EventId
        C-->>O: downstream event with causation = inbound EventId
    end
